    "detailed_description": "<h1>NEW DEMO AVAILABLE NOW!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/cddfe8ae9f4b42c9c9ef185c35fa90fb.avif?t=1752798465\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the new demo for Ground Zero Hero - new polish, new balance and new surprises!</p></p><br><h1>GET YOUR FREAK ON</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.poster.avif?t=1752798465\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.webm?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/7fcac7994c5794ba4844476e670c4844.mp4?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's post-apocalyptic fun times in this 'horde survival' action roguelite! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy screen-filling mobs of mutated wildlife, absorb their radioactive guts and become an overpowered freak of the wasteland! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.poster.avif?t=1752798465\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.webm?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.mp4?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.poster.avif?t=1752798465\" width=558 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.webm?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.mp4?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's post-apocalyptic fun times in this 'horde survival' action roguelite! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy screen-filling mobs of mutated wildlife, absorb their radioactive guts and become an overpowered freak of the wasteland! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.poster.avif?t=1752798465\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.webm?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/99e22694c5a8bd5a373271d1dc8e28ba.mp4?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.poster.avif?t=1752798465\" width=558 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.webm?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570580/extras/0563ab39fce0d43687f7ef75f57e4168.mp4?t=1752798465\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
